TEST 06_minimal_nucre — 150 MeV protons in water, nuclear reactions enabled
21.05.2026 / Niels Bassler

OpenTOPAS cross-validation reference case for tests/cases/06_minimal_nucre.
Physics: g4em-standard_opt3 + QGSP_BIC (Binary Intranuclear Cascade).
Nuclear reactions are ON by default with hadronic physics loaded.

Run:
  cd tests/reference/topas/06_minimal_nucre
  topas run.txt

Output: NB_energy.csv, NB_fluence.csv (one value per Z bin, per primary)

Plot comparison with OSH and SH12A:
  python3 tools/plot_nucre.py
